  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t<figure class=\"wp-caption center\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-6166\" src=\"/media/archive/3512afa5f57a5bcdb10052ae1f01e28402fdaef6676815b09d85d933fee327f9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Weedie, Katherine Vacca, Mary Shepard, Celince Federici and Donna Tavano are all 'Thursday Open Painting' regulars.</figcaption></figure>\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-ff018cd9606c9d21e3a0/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Image</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2022-07-01T17:36:18-04:00\" title=\"Friday, July 1, 2022, 5:36 pm\">July 1, 2022</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gmail_default\">Due to member requests, the Guild’s weekly ‘Thursday Open Painting’ sessions has been extended through the summer.  Sessions take place in the Harwich Community Center from 1pm to 3:30pm. Members are invited to bring their painting supplies and share painting approaches to their individual paintings. If you are a new member the sessions provide an opportunity to learn more about the Guild and resources available to you.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
